  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Program to improve the quality of early childhood services in Peru</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de mejora de la calidad de los servicios de Primera Infancia en Per</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general del Programa es lograr que los nios y nias menores de 36 meses en situacin de pobreza o pobreza extrema reciban servicios de calidad adecuada para su desarrollo. Los objetivos especficos son: (i) lograr una adecuada capacidad operativa para la prestacin de los servicios del Programa Nacional Cuna Ms (PNCM); y (ii) lograr adecuadas condiciones de funcionamiento de los Centros Infantiles de Atencin Integral (CIAI) intervenidos.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective of the Program is to ensure that children under 36 months of age living in poverty or extreme poverty receive services of adequate quality to support their development. The specific objectives are: (i) to achieve sufficient operational capacity for the provision of services under the National Cuna Ms Program (PNCM); and (ii) to ensure adequate operating conditions for the Comprehensive Child Care Centers (CIAI) that are being supported.</narrative>
  </description>
